   "id": 321597,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Eduardo has two groups of four friends, group A and group B. Within each group, each of the members of the group are friends with each other but not with those in the other group. The individuals in group A have no other friends, but the individuals in group B each has their own group of four friends, and the individuals within those groups are all friends with each other, but with no one outside their own group. Draw a graph to represent the given scenario.",
